        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As the largest provider of parts cleaning services in North America, we offer a complete line of specially designed parts washers to customer locations and then deliver recurring service that includes machine cleaning, maintenance, disposal and replenishment of clean solvent or aqueous fluids.",
