        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide total project management services in areas such as chemical packing, on-site waste management, remediation, compliance training and emergency spill response, while leveraging Clean Harbors’ network of service centers and environmental capabilities.",
